==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 0.07~6 seconds<sup>2f~180f</sup>.
*1 [[Type 10 (Hometown Self-Defense Force)|Type 10]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[THE SLOTH]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn, delay 2~8 seconds<sup>60f~240f</sup>.
**Infinite [[St. Pigge the 2nd]]s spawn, delay 100~120 seconds<sup>3,000f~3,600f</sup>.
**3 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]]s spawn, delay 50~60 seconds<sup>1,500f~1,800f</sup>.
**2 [[Celeboodle]]s spawn, delay 0.07~0.13 seconds<sup>2f~4f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Type 10 (Hometown Self-Defense Force)|Type 10s]] spawn, delay 60~80 seconds<sup>1,800f~2,400f</sup>.

